# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:16
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_ecf13bb5:

    # mc "Does it hurt?"
    mc "还疼吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:18
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_561e1076:

    # ri "It used to hurt, but it reached a point where it looks worse than it feels."
    ri "以前会疼，但到了某个程度，看起来比实际感觉更糟。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:19
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_d93f1422:

    # ri "How bad does it look to you?"
    ri "你觉得有多难看？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:23
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_4e83241d:

    # mc "It doesn't look great. I can tell you've been through some trauma."
    mc "看起来不怎么好。我能感觉到你经历了一些创伤。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:25
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_93335f31:

    # ri "Yeah. It's tough hiding it from people. There's only so much I can cover up with my hair."
    ri "嗯。很难瞒着别人。我只能用头发遮住那么一点点。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:27
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_49903e06:

    # mc "You're still pretty."
    mc "你还是挺好看的。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:29
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_da98cffe:

    # ri "There's no need to lie, [name]."
    ri "没必要撒谎，[name]."

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:31
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_c09b6015:

    # mc "What happened to you?"
    mc "你到底怎么了？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:34
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_c3f27702:

    # ri "I thought Quinn already told you everything."
    ri "我以为你已经从Quinn那里听说了一切。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:36
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_2cf40ad9:

    # mc "I heard her side of the story. Now, I want to hear it from you."
    mc "我听过她那边的故事了。现在，我想听听你这边怎么说。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:38
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_f1dfb0ed:

    # ri "It's been hell."
    ri "这他妈真是见鬼了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:39
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_2b30962f:

    # ri "I keep having nightmares about that night."
    ri "我一直在做那个夜晚的噩梦。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:41
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_e6b38025:

    # ri "How they abducted me. Forced me to tell everything about Quinn."
    ri "他们是怎么绑架我的。强迫我交代关于Quinn的一切。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:42
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_acee0b76:

    # ri "And even after I did..."
    ri "而且在我交代完之后，他们还继续折磨我。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:44
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_1d3daca8:

    # ri "They wanted to make sure I wasn't lying."
    ri "他们想确认我是不是在撒谎。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:46
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_f845c0d6:

    # ri "Buddy had a pair of pliers. And he..."
    ri "Buddy拿着钳子，一个一个地拔出来。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:47
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_6e7c85ab:

    # ri "He ripped the piercings out. One by one."
    ri "他一个一个把耳钉扯了出来。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:49
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_9d8f9fd9:

    # ri "The septum piercing hurt like hell."
    ri "鼻环疼得要命。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:50
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_2176dba6:

    # ri "I'm thankful he didn't spot my tongue piercing."
    ri "我很庆幸他没发现我的舌头穿孔。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:52
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_7c2b0476:

    # ri "I removed it after I got back to Mom's place."
    ri "我是在回到妈妈家之后才取下来的。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:55
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_27045c00:

    # mc "Rio... I can't imagine what you went through."
    mc "里奥娜...我实在想象不出你经历了什么。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:59
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_97569717:

    # mc "Why didn't you go to the police?"
    mc "为什么你不报警？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:61
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_c303bf40:

    # ri "And say what? \"The drug dealers whose drugs I've been selling roughed me up.\""
    ri "而且说啥？“那些我卖毒品的毒贩子把我打了。”"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:62
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_6c13e657:

    # ri "It would have made things worse for me. And that's why I didn't even go to the hospital."
    ri "这会让我情况更糟。所以我连医院都没去。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:64
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_209d4bd5:

    # ri "I've been scared about what they would do to Mom if they found out I told anyone. They threatened her, too."
    ri "我怕他们知道了我把这事告诉了别人，会怎么对待妈妈。他们甚至威胁过她。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:65
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_43c85258:

    # ri "This is all Quinn's fault."
    ri "这全都是Quinn的错。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:67
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_4587324f:

    # ri "I want to make her pay so fucking bad for what she's done to me, but I don't know how."
    ri "我想让她为她对我做的事付出代价，可我就是不知道该怎么做。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:69
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_70c28b37:

    # mc "What was her part in this?"
    mc "她在这事里扮演了什么角色？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:71
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_5246a779:

    # ri "We sold the drugs Buddy provided at a higher price and pocketed the profit."
    ri "我们把毒品以更高的价格卖给了Buddy，然后把赚到的钱都揣进兜里了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:72
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_95be0d3e:

    # ri "It was Quinn's idea, and she reassured me that I was safe."
    ri "这是Quinn的主意，她还向我保证不会有危险。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:74
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_bbb6d4cf:

    # ri "She told me they didn't even know about me, but she was wrong. "
    ri "她说他们甚至不知道我的存在，但她错了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:75
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_c5ce8250:

    # ri "They were watching me, and I got to pay the price that was hers to pay."
    ri "他们一直在盯着我，而我却为她该承担的代价付出了代价。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:77
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_9cb7da9d:

    # ri "She has lied to me so many times that I've lost count."
    ri "她骗了我太多次，我都数不清了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:78
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_9afd05ed:

    # ri "She thought she had it all under control and refused to listen to me when I told her we should calm down and not take risks."
    ri "她以为自己一切都在掌控之中，我劝她冷静下来别冒险，她根本听不进去。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:80
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_8014bba1:

    # ri "If she only had stopped thinking about money for one fucking minute..."
    ri "如果她只是他妈的停上一分钟别想着钱……"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:82
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_12b43e4e:

    # ri "I don't know what to do now, [name]."
    ri "我现在不知道该怎么办了[name]."

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:84
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_ce12675f:

    # mc "Rio... I wish I could help you."
    mc "里奥娜... 我真希望我能帮你。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:86
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_e3d1d9a4:

    # ri "I'm waiting things out now. Waiting for the scars to heal so I can show my face again."
    ri "我现在就等着吧。等伤疤好了，我就能重新露面了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:87
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_d3af50f0:

    # ri "I asked the dean for another shot at the finals because I didn't study for them, and I can't show up looking like this."
    ri "我向院长申请再给一次期末考试的机会，因为我根本没复习，而且现在这副样子根本没法出现在考场。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:89
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_754f3316:

    # ri "He will arrange for me to take the tests in January. But I don't think that's enough time to fully heal."
    ri "他会安排我一月份再参加考试。但我觉得这时间根本不够我彻底恢复。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:90
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_441079b8:

    # ri "I will have to face my friends looking like this. And I won't be able to answer their questions without lying."
    ri "我得这样面对朋友们。而且我没办法直接回答他们的问题，只能撒谎。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:92
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_42a481b9:

    # ri "What would the lie even be? I..."
    ri "什么谎话才说得出口啊……我……"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:94
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_f09f7071:

    # mc "They will be concerned, but what happened to you is private if you want it to be."
    mc "他们可能会担心，但如果你愿意，发生的事可以保持私密。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:96
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_f3de3ad4:

    # ri "You won't tell anyone about this, right?"
    ri "你不会把这事告诉别人，对吧？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:98
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_008c63f2:

    # mc "I can keep this a secret if that's what you're asking."
    mc "我可以替你保守这个秘密，如果你这么问的话。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:100
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_34896a9e:

    # ri "Thank you, [name]."
    ri "谢谢，[name]."

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:102
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_81fcff94:

    # ri "Did Quinn tell you anything else?"
    ri "Quinn还告诉你别的事了吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:104
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_52b5f423:

    # mc "She seemed remorseful."
    mc "她看起来有些懊悔。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:106
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_5c38a3f5:

    # ri "Have you talked to Quinn?"
    ri "你和Quinn谈过吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:109
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_fb335c07:

    # mc "Not about this. She has seemed distant lately. Now I get why."
    mc "不是关于这个的。她最近看起来有点疏远。现在我明白为什么了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:111
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_0d9c8740:

    # mc "We don't talk that much, but she's seemed distant lately."
    mc "我们没怎么聊，但她最近似乎有点疏远。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:112
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_26baaaf9:

    # mc "Have you talked to her?"
    mc "你跟她谈过了吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:114
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_95e0a8d3:

    # ri "She showed up at my mom's place after it happened and tried to apologize, but I punched her in her stupid face."
    ri "她事情发生后跑到我妈妈家，想道歉，但我直接打了她脸。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:115
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_d66c9843:

    # ri "And I told her I didn't want to see her again. That was the last time I saw her."
    ri "我还告诉她我不想再见到她了。那是我最后一次见到她。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:117
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_a3203eeb:

    # mc "Do you think you'll eventually talk it out with her?"
    mc "你觉得你们最终能跟她谈谈吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:119
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_dd2bb89a:

    # ri "Well, I can't fucking avoid her, can I?"
    ri "那我又能怎么办，总不能躲着她吧？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:120
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_5cc14eec:

    # ri "She lives in the same house as me."
    ri "她住在我同一个房子里。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:122
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_e8150bb9:

    # ri "And I can't do anything about it, because I'll be in trouble if I do."
    ri "而且我也没法做些什么，因为我如果做了的话就会惹上麻烦。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:123
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_8a86c232:

    # ri "My hands are tied..."
    ri "我的手被捆住了..."

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:128
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_39193bf5:

    # ri "My only two options are to suck it up or drop out of college."
    ri "我只有两个选择，要么硬撑下去，要么退学。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:129
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_8f8c629f:

    # ri "But I don't want to drop out. I want to stay here."
    ri "但我也不想退学。我想继续待在这里。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:131
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_e5d40218:

    # ri "But I don't want to stay near her!"
    ri "但我不想跟她住得太近！"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:133
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_8e76f9ba:

    # mc "What if you got yourself a dorm?"
    mc "那你要不要换个宿舍？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:135
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_07f6a597:

    # ri "I feel like that would start drama. What do you think I should do?"
    ri "我觉得这样会引发麻烦。你觉得我该怎么办？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:139
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_9b8d7f19:

    # mc "I think you should talk to Quinn again. Even though she's done you wrong, I don't think it was intentional."
    mc "我觉得你应该再跟Quinn谈谈。虽然她对你做过一些不好的事，但我觉得她不是故意的。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:141
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_47444b2c:

    # ri "Did she tell you to say that?"
    ri "她告诉你这么说的吗？"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:143
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_869eee83:

    # mc "No. I think she's self-sabotaging because of the life she's lived. But I saw something in her..."
    mc "不，我觉得她是因为过着那样的生活而自我毁灭。但我看到她身上有某些东西……"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:144
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_cbf7d3b8:

    # mc "I think she deeply regrets what she did to you, but doesn't know how to change."
    mc "我觉得她真的很后悔对你做了那些事，但不知道该怎么改变。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:146
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2_label_06f3a401:

    # mc "Maybe if you helped her, she'd have an easier time with it."
    mc "也许如果你帮她一把，她会好过一些。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:150
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_1cc361b5:

    # ri "You can't be serious, [name]! Look at what she's done to me."
    ri "你不可能是认真的[name]看看她对我做了什么。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:151
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_cd829b89:

    # ri "There's no chance in hell that I'll patch things up with her after this."
    ri "我绝不会在经历了这一切之后还去跟她和好。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:152
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_fc2a1ab5:

    # ri "Stop trying to defend her."
    ri "别再替她开脱了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:154
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_6d77e7ca:

    # mc "I'm sorry, Rio. I didn't mean to upset you."
    mc "对不起，里奥娜。我不是故意让你不开心的。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:156
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_06f1f313:

    # ri "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    ri "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:157
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_0ebb019f:

    # ri "Sometimes you have to draw a line and stick to it. I should have done that a long time ago, but I kept cutting her slack."
    ri "有时候你得划清界限，坚持自己的立场。我早该这么做，但一直对她太宽容了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:158
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_55dcb941:

    # ri "I won't let it happen again."
    ri "我不会再让这种事情发生了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:160
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_02643501:

    # mc "I hear you."
    mc "我听到了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:164
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_b053995a:

    # ri "I'm gonna head out."
    ri "我得走了。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:166
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_7c15793f:

    # mc "Right... You know how to find me. Call, text, visit...whenever you need it."
    mc "好...你知道怎么找我。打电话、发信息、或者直接来，什么时候需要都行。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:171
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_5bb2ddf5:

    # mc "I think you should do what you feel is right. I will support whatever you choose, regardless."
    mc "我觉得你该做自己觉得对的事。无论你做出什么选择，我都会支持你。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:173
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_17ab785a:

    # mc "Like I told Quinn, I can't defend her actions."
    mc "就像我跟Quinn说的，我没法为她的行为辩护。"

# freeroam\episode12\ep12_freeroam_room2_events.rpy:174
translate schinese ep12_freeroam_room2c_label_6d6f2201:

